//: selfhost_memo_trait_public_surface_stage0_trait_item_with_body: stage0 用 body 付き trait item を[作/つく]る
fn selfhost_memo_trait_public_surface_stage0_trait_item_with_body %fn i32 fn i32 fn str SelfhostModuleItem \start\end\lexeme:
