fn selfhost_memo_trait_public_surface_stage0_two_item_scan_result %impure fn str impure fn SelfhostModuleItem impure fn SelfhostModuleItem Result SelfhostMemoTraitPublicSurfaceSeedScan SelfhostMemoTraitPublicSurfaceSeedErrorKind \source\first\second:
